&#8220;ongoing,&#8221; or the negative thereof or variations thereon or similar terminology generally intended to identify forward-looking statements. All statements, other than historical </B></P>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">2 </P>

</DIV></Center>


